  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: $\\sqrt{30^2+\\left(90-V_{\\mathrm{L}}\\right)^2}=50$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{L}}=50 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\\n& =\\left(\\mathrm{V}_{\\mathrm{L}}\\right)_{\\max }=50 \\sqrt{2} \\mathrm{~V}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
